g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cc/h289iblzogutaolck06a053tl7pjjn9.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%8E%9A%E7%A7%AF%E5%BC%BA%E5%8F%91.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cc/h289iblzogutaolck06a053tl7pjjn9.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />厚积强发\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，自身拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">4%</font>，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">4%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，自身拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">8%</font>，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">8%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，自身拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">12%</font>，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">12%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"勇气之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/40px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/60px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/80px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：80<img alt=\"勇气之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/40px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/60px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/80px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，三级：180<img alt=\"勇气之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/40px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/60px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/80px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"1\">可习得该极限解放的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9C%B2%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%9A%E9%87%8E%E7%8B%90%E6%8A%95%E6%9E%AA%E5%85%B5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/露西亚野狐投枪兵\"><img alt=\"头像 露西亚野狐投枪兵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/34/7kcgys5m0vz3grcek9270lxehqey6va.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">露西亚野狐投枪兵</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E